WEBVTT

00:12.875 --> 00:17.458
[narrator] There were 950 years
of samurai history,

00:19.000 --> 00:22.583
yet it only took a single battle

00:22.666 --> 00:25.500
for an entire breed of warriors…

00:25.583 --> 00:26.583
[men shouting]

00:26.666 --> 00:28.375
…to vanish.

00:28.958 --> 00:31.666
-[dramatic music playing]
-[shouting continues]

00:34.750 --> 00:36.375
[man 1 shrieks]

00:36.458 --> 00:39.166
-[grunting]
-[groaning, yelping]

00:41.041 --> 00:42.916
Forward! Come on!

00:45.500 --> 00:46.708
Forward!

00:54.416 --> 00:56.583
[dramatic music intensifies]

00:57.250 --> 00:58.250
[man 1 panting]

00:59.833 --> 01:01.083
-[grunts]
-[man 2 yelps]

01:01.166 --> 01:03.791
-[man 1 grunting, panting]
-[man 3 shrieks]

01:05.458 --> 01:07.916
[men shouting, groaning]

01:17.958 --> 01:19.250
[man 1 panting]

01:30.333 --> 01:32.166
[screaming]

01:40.666 --> 01:41.666
[grunting]

01:42.916 --> 01:44.666
[tense music playing]

01:50.833 --> 01:52.500
[breathing heavily]

01:53.125 --> 01:54.375
[both grunting]

01:56.625 --> 01:57.666
[squelching]

01:58.791 --> 02:00.333
[cymbal crashing]

02:00.416 --> 02:01.875
It's over!

02:01.958 --> 02:03.458
Victory is ours!

02:03.541 --> 02:05.375
[men cheering]

02:05.458 --> 02:07.958
Raise the smoke signal!

02:09.375 --> 02:10.750
[flare bursts]

02:10.833 --> 02:13.666
[man 4 shouts] Yeah!

02:15.250 --> 02:17.916
-[cannon firing]
-[cannonball whistles]

02:18.541 --> 02:20.125
[men shouting]

02:21.583 --> 02:22.625
What's that?

02:22.708 --> 02:23.791
What's going on?!

02:25.083 --> 02:27.041
Stand down! Stop it!

02:27.125 --> 02:29.333
It's over! Stop!

02:29.416 --> 02:31.166
-[cannonballs whistling]
-[gunshots]

02:32.625 --> 02:34.625
[men yelping, groaning]

02:38.250 --> 02:39.500
[coughing]

02:41.708 --> 02:43.541
-[groaning]
-[men screaming]

02:43.625 --> 02:45.458
[explosions]

02:45.541 --> 02:47.541
[bullets whizzing by]

02:49.833 --> 02:50.833
[yelps]

02:52.250 --> 02:53.250
Stop!

02:53.333 --> 02:54.291
Stand down!

02:57.250 --> 03:00.458
Stand down!

03:00.541 --> 03:02.291
[battle noises fade]

03:04.916 --> 03:06.166
[breathing heavily]

03:06.250 --> 03:07.958
[high-pitched ringing]

03:28.083 --> 03:30.083
[unsettling music playing]

03:59.541 --> 04:02.208
[unsettling music intensifies]

04:02.291 --> 04:03.333
[gasps]

04:03.416 --> 04:05.083
[breathing heavily]

04:19.125 --> 04:21.125
[woman coughing, vomiting]

04:28.958 --> 04:30.791
[woman breathing heavily]

04:30.875 --> 04:32.291
[wind whistling]

04:38.833 --> 04:39.875
Shino.

04:40.875 --> 04:43.666
-I'll help you.
-Sorry, I didn't mean to wake you.

04:44.625 --> 04:46.875
[gasps, whimpers]

04:46.958 --> 04:49.041
Toya, can you get me a hand towel?

04:49.125 --> 04:50.541
-'Kay.
-[girl coughs]

04:54.166 --> 04:55.291
Open up.

05:00.250 --> 05:01.375
Father…

05:01.875 --> 05:02.875
[man] Hm?

05:04.250 --> 05:05.708
It hurts.

05:08.083 --> 05:10.916
Rin. You'll be fine.

05:11.000 --> 05:12.416
You'll feel better soon.

05:13.208 --> 05:14.083
[sighs]

05:14.875 --> 05:19.166
I'm sorry.
I was the first one who was sick.

05:19.250 --> 05:20.916
Everything is my fault.

05:21.500 --> 05:22.875
It's not your fault.

05:26.750 --> 05:27.708
Thank you.

05:38.125 --> 05:41.875
FUCHU, KANAGAWA

05:42.666 --> 05:45.125
[exhales, groans softly]

06:09.666 --> 06:11.125
[straining]

06:21.666 --> 06:23.125
[unsettling music playing]

06:23.208 --> 06:25.375
-[men screaming]
-[gunshots, explosions]

06:25.458 --> 06:26.500
[breathing shakily]

06:28.833 --> 06:30.666
[man] Stand down! Stop it!

06:31.250 --> 06:35.458
It's over! Stand down!

06:36.333 --> 06:37.583
[whimpering]

06:37.666 --> 06:39.416
[battle noises fade]

06:39.500 --> 06:40.833
[panting]

06:50.458 --> 06:52.375
[somber music playing]

06:55.416 --> 06:57.625
[narrator] A decade after the Boshin War…

06:57.708 --> 06:58.666
[child crying]

06:58.750 --> 07:01.000
…the new government's
modernization policies

07:01.083 --> 07:03.708
reclassified the samurai as "shizoku,"

07:03.791 --> 07:07.375
stripping them
of their privileges and employment.

07:08.083 --> 07:14.000
Meanwhile, people's lives were devastated
by the widespread cholera outbreak.

07:17.291 --> 07:18.500
[man coughing]

07:26.291 --> 07:29.750
-[child] Mama! Mama!
-[sighs]

07:33.041 --> 07:35.958
[man sighs] Saga-san.

07:36.041 --> 07:37.375
I don't know what to say.

07:37.458 --> 07:40.083
You can't keep
bringing me worthless things.

07:40.583 --> 07:43.375
[whispers] I'm sorry, but… Please…

07:43.458 --> 07:45.083
Don't make this harder
than it needs to be.

07:45.666 --> 07:48.166
Swords have been banished
for two years now.

07:48.750 --> 07:52.208
You know as well as I do
those days are behind us.

07:55.375 --> 07:58.333
Saga-san… Please, don't do this to me.

07:58.416 --> 07:59.666
I'll take anything you can give.

08:00.875 --> 08:04.333
Once cholera passes,
I'll repay your kindness.

08:04.416 --> 08:05.541
Please,

08:07.083 --> 08:08.250
I'm begging you.

08:10.083 --> 08:11.083
[sighs]

08:13.541 --> 08:15.916
Shino and your daughter…

08:16.916 --> 08:18.166
Are they doing that badly?

08:19.375 --> 08:21.375
[Saga breathes shakily]

08:24.666 --> 08:25.666
[sighs]

08:26.958 --> 08:28.166
Hey.

08:28.750 --> 08:30.875
Go get some sugar and salt for him.

08:30.958 --> 08:31.791
[woman] All right.

08:35.958 --> 08:37.791
I don't need your sword.

08:38.541 --> 08:39.833
Keep it.

08:41.666 --> 08:43.833
[exhales] Thank you so much.

08:43.916 --> 08:44.916
[man sighs]

08:46.041 --> 08:47.666
What a time we're living in.

08:50.166 --> 08:52.333
How did it ever come to this?

08:57.916 --> 08:59.291
[man 1] When did this get put up?

08:59.375 --> 09:02.000
[man 2] I don't know.
It wasn't there yesterday, right?

09:03.500 --> 09:05.208
[man 1] It says it's in Kyoto.

09:05.291 --> 09:07.458
[man 2] "An opportunity
to win 100,000 yen."

09:07.541 --> 09:09.916
-[man 1] A hundred thousand?
-It can't be true.

09:10.458 --> 09:12.125
What sort of nonsense is that?

09:12.208 --> 09:14.750
I doubt this is even real.
These people must think we're all fools.

09:14.833 --> 09:17.166
But if it were real,

09:18.000 --> 09:19.916
you could feed
a whole family for a century!

09:20.000 --> 09:23.458
[man 2 laughs] That seems
too good to be true, right?

09:23.541 --> 09:26.500
[man 1 chuckles] Here. I'll have one.

09:26.583 --> 09:29.208
PARTICIPANTS WANTED
ASSEMBLE AT TENRYUJI TEMPLE IN KYOTO

09:29.291 --> 09:33.208
[Saga] "Those who excel in martial arts…
Tenryuji Temple…"

09:33.291 --> 09:34.500
"Prize…

09:35.583 --> 09:37.250
100,000 yen."

09:38.875 --> 09:42.208
-[man 2] Whatever this is, it's unusual.
-[man 1] Could we compete?

09:42.291 --> 09:43.916
-[man 2] I don't know.
-[whistle blowing]

09:44.000 --> 09:45.916
Hey! What are you doing?

09:46.000 --> 09:48.833
-[man 1] What's the problem?
-[official] Hold it right there!

09:48.916 --> 09:51.791
-Can you tell us what this is?
-Give me the pamphlets, all of you!

09:51.875 --> 09:53.916
-We just wanna know.
-This has nothing to do with you.

09:54.000 --> 09:56.000
-Hand it over! Step back!
-You're just as guilty!

09:57.291 --> 09:58.125
[Saga sighs]

10:03.375 --> 10:04.375
[Shino shouts] Rin!

10:05.250 --> 10:07.083
-Rin!
-[gasps]

10:08.250 --> 10:09.083
[Shino] Rin!

10:09.750 --> 10:10.833
Rin!

10:10.916 --> 10:12.500
-Rin!
-[Shino] Rin! Rin!

10:12.583 --> 10:13.416
Rin!

10:14.000 --> 10:15.750
Rin! Rin! [breathing shakily]

10:15.833 --> 10:19.166
-Rin! Rin? Rin?
-Rin!

10:22.750 --> 10:24.166
[Rin] Father…

10:28.000 --> 10:34.875
I… I couldn't…
I couldn't save Mother and Toya.

10:37.208 --> 10:38.833
I'm really sorry.

10:38.916 --> 10:41.375
[somber music playing]

10:42.791 --> 10:44.083
Rin!

10:45.000 --> 10:46.041
Rin!

10:46.916 --> 10:47.750
Rin…

10:50.250 --> 10:51.166
[Saga] Rin…

10:54.916 --> 10:56.916
[inhales sharply]

11:07.125 --> 11:08.750
[sobbing]

11:09.750 --> 11:11.291
Forgive me.

11:18.333 --> 11:19.583
[sobbing]

11:33.958 --> 11:35.833
[monk chanting]

11:45.750 --> 11:48.250
[gasping, panting]

11:56.666 --> 11:57.666
[sobbing]

12:11.625 --> 12:13.208
[insects chirping]

12:21.916 --> 12:23.291
[inhales deeply]

12:35.375 --> 12:41.750
ASSEMBLE AT TENRYUJI TEMPLE IN KYOTO
AT MIDNIGHT ON MAY 5TH

12:57.000 --> 12:58.250
[breathing heavily]

13:12.291 --> 13:13.125
[bell chimes]

13:15.916 --> 13:17.291
[exhales deeply]

13:22.291 --> 13:23.458
Shujiro-san?

13:26.250 --> 13:27.375
Shino.

13:28.916 --> 13:32.541
I'm really sorry,
but I'll be gone for a little while.

13:33.125 --> 13:35.375
I've found a job
that could bring in some money.

13:41.750 --> 13:44.833
If I get the money, we'll be safe,

13:45.833 --> 13:47.708
and so will everyone in the village.

13:52.666 --> 13:56.000
Are you going to draw your sword again?

13:58.416 --> 13:59.708
No, don't worry.

14:01.125 --> 14:02.541
It won't come to that.

14:04.208 --> 14:06.166
[brooding music playing]

14:15.625 --> 14:17.125
Please stay safe.

14:28.208 --> 14:29.708
I'll come back to you.

14:32.833 --> 14:33.833
All right.

14:35.791 --> 14:37.791
[dramatic music playing]

15:17.583 --> 15:22.000
KYOTO

15:22.083 --> 15:24.791
-[indistinct chatter]
-[folk music playing]

15:42.333 --> 15:45.666
[man] Oh, by the way,
you saw the papers, right?

15:45.750 --> 15:48.833
I did. They say it's part
of a government sword hunt.

15:48.916 --> 15:51.083
[boy] Mom, please, can we go?
We wanna see.

15:51.166 --> 15:53.958
It's not safe. You're not going
anywhere near Tenryuji Temple.

15:54.041 --> 15:56.666
-[girl] Why? But I really wanna go!
-[woman] That is final.

16:05.958 --> 16:07.958
-[Saga exhales]
-[woman] Welcome.

16:08.041 --> 16:08.958
[man] Welcome.

16:13.916 --> 16:16.666
-Saga? It can't be.
-Hello, Yahei.

16:17.208 --> 16:18.333
It's been a while.

16:18.833 --> 16:20.291
It's been a while indeed.

16:22.666 --> 16:26.083
Oh, wait. Saga, are you involved as well?

16:26.166 --> 16:27.708
So you've seen others like me?

16:27.791 --> 16:30.750
Yes. I've seen a couple.

16:31.291 --> 16:34.375
I've noticed a few guests carrying swords.

16:35.666 --> 16:36.666
Mm.

16:37.875 --> 16:39.625
And do you know anything about it?

16:40.625 --> 16:43.250
Well, rumor has it that some survivors

16:43.333 --> 16:47.500
of the old shogunate forces
are seeking allies for revenge.

16:47.583 --> 16:49.333
But it's nothing more than rumors.

16:49.416 --> 16:51.250
There's no telling what's true.

16:52.791 --> 16:53.958
Is that right?

16:55.916 --> 16:57.083
[dog barking]

17:09.791 --> 17:11.208
[exhales deeply]

17:12.833 --> 17:13.833
[straining]

17:14.958 --> 17:16.916
[unsettling music playing]

17:17.000 --> 17:18.666
[breathing shakily]

17:23.625 --> 17:25.875
-[knocking]
-[Yahei] Saga-sama, may I come in?

17:27.541 --> 17:28.458
Yes.

17:35.833 --> 17:37.916
You're getting ready to go, I see.

17:38.458 --> 17:39.375
Yes.

17:41.125 --> 17:42.041
Be careful.

17:42.708 --> 17:44.916
Kyoto feels different tonight.

17:46.083 --> 17:48.458
It feels just like the old days.

17:50.125 --> 17:53.416
That same iron scent
of blood hangs heavy in the air.

17:55.375 --> 17:57.166
Look after yourself, Saga.

17:58.708 --> 18:01.666
-[exhales]
-[ominous music playing]

18:10.791 --> 18:15.125
TENRYUJI TEMPLE

18:15.208 --> 18:17.125
[indistinct murmuring]

18:34.708 --> 18:36.583
Are you here to participate?

18:38.875 --> 18:39.875
Doors.

18:45.166 --> 18:47.958
-[man 1] Whoa!
-[man 2] They opened the gate!

18:51.083 --> 18:53.000
-[guard] Enter.
-[exhales]

19:01.041 --> 19:01.875
[doors slam]

19:12.041 --> 19:13.166
[indistinct chatter]

19:22.541 --> 19:24.791
[ominous music intensifies]

19:32.250 --> 19:34.250
[breathing shakily]

19:40.083 --> 19:41.791
[man 3] Hey, hey, hey!

19:43.875 --> 19:45.041
[man 4] Shut up!

19:46.208 --> 19:47.250
[man 5] You shut up!

20:13.500 --> 20:15.166
[exhales deeply]

20:16.833 --> 20:18.416
[breathing shakily]

20:21.083 --> 20:26.125
[man 6] Ugh.
Ah, look at all this. This chaos.

20:30.833 --> 20:31.666
[chuckling]

20:33.125 --> 20:35.500
Everyone's blinded by the fortune, right?

20:35.583 --> 20:38.875
Wouldn't surprise me
if someone drew a sword before it starts.

20:41.166 --> 20:43.375
Oh, uh, I'm sorry. Uh…

20:43.458 --> 20:45.708
I need the sound
of my own voice to keep calm.

20:45.791 --> 20:48.041
[laughs, clears throat]

20:48.125 --> 20:52.666
Oh, by the way… Tachikawa Kouemon,
a former samurai from Kaga.

20:52.750 --> 20:56.500
Wait, you're from Kaga?
So the papers made it that far?

20:56.583 --> 21:01.916
[breathing heavily] Yes, in fact, uh,
I've been speaking with folks all day.

21:02.000 --> 21:06.083
From Hokkaido all the way to Ryukyu.
There's someone from every region.

21:06.166 --> 21:07.250
And you know what?

21:07.333 --> 21:09.875
I'd say if the hosts are willing
to go that far,

21:10.875 --> 21:12.583
then that means it's feasible

21:12.666 --> 21:15.250
that the 100,000 isn't a lie after all.

21:19.708 --> 21:21.291
[ominous music ends]

21:21.375 --> 21:22.916
[crowd murmuring]

21:33.916 --> 21:35.833
[indistinct muttering]

21:39.708 --> 21:40.958
[gasping]

21:41.041 --> 21:42.000
Huh?

22:01.958 --> 22:04.416
[foreboding music playing]

22:04.500 --> 22:05.791
Who's that?

22:09.625 --> 22:11.666
The time has come at last.

22:11.750 --> 22:14.625
Let us begin.
I will proceed with the opening.

22:16.458 --> 22:18.916
First off, I'd like
to thank each and every one of you

22:19.000 --> 22:20.416
for being here tonight.

22:21.041 --> 22:22.958
I'll introduce myself.

22:23.041 --> 22:24.625
Enju is my name.

22:24.708 --> 22:26.916
-It's an honor to meet you.
-[indistinct murmuring]

22:29.500 --> 22:31.250
Tonight, you will enter into a game

22:31.333 --> 22:34.375
that will truly test your spirit
and your skill

22:34.458 --> 22:35.958
and your physical limits.

22:36.041 --> 22:37.625
[man 7] Get on with it. Come on.

22:37.708 --> 22:40.291
-[man 8] We didn't come for a game.
-[man 7] We're not here all day.

22:40.375 --> 22:42.375
Yes, yes. I don't blame you.

22:42.458 --> 22:44.833
You just play a game
and walk away with a fortune?

22:44.916 --> 22:47.708
A fortune
that you aren't even sure exists?

22:47.791 --> 22:49.583
I imagine you're quite anxious.

22:49.666 --> 22:50.583
[clicks tongue]

22:53.041 --> 22:55.333
[foreboding music intensifies]

22:55.416 --> 22:57.000
[crowd murmuring indistinctly]

23:05.500 --> 23:06.666
What do you think that's for?

23:12.125 --> 23:14.041
[gasping, clamoring]

23:18.791 --> 23:22.791
There's enough gold in this pot
for ten years of luxury and ease.

23:22.875 --> 23:25.708
And yet, compared to what you could earn
if you choose to stay,

23:27.500 --> 23:28.666
this is nothing.

23:28.750 --> 23:31.041
[gasping, cheering]

23:36.791 --> 23:37.916
[Tachikawa laughs]

23:38.000 --> 23:40.833
[Enju] So the question is how you earn it.

23:40.916 --> 23:41.916
Ah…

23:42.708 --> 23:43.750
Well…

23:44.791 --> 23:46.625
The thing is

23:47.583 --> 23:49.958
you cannot back out
once you've been told the rules,

23:50.041 --> 23:51.375
no matter what.

23:51.458 --> 23:53.208
[crowd muttering indistinctly]

23:55.958 --> 23:58.958
I will now begin
counting down from thirty.

23:59.041 --> 24:02.125
If you have no desire to join us tonight,

24:02.208 --> 24:04.625
feel free to step out now.

24:06.458 --> 24:08.750
-Thirty. Twenty-nine.
-[man 9] Oh, now he's counting.

24:08.833 --> 24:10.041
[clamoring]

24:10.125 --> 24:11.750
-Twenty-eight.
-[man 10] Tell us the rules!

24:11.833 --> 24:12.875
Twenty-seven.

24:12.958 --> 24:14.583
-[man 11] I'm not backing out!
-Twenty-six.

24:15.166 --> 24:16.875
-Twenty-five.
-[man 10] Tell us the rules!

24:16.958 --> 24:18.250
[man 12] That's enough!

24:18.333 --> 24:19.500
-[crowd goes quiet]
-Huh?

24:19.583 --> 24:20.625
[faint murmuring]

24:27.666 --> 24:29.500
[tense music playing]

24:32.375 --> 24:33.291
Stay where you are.

24:34.958 --> 24:37.583
I'm Ando, Fourth Division, Kyoto PD.

24:38.166 --> 24:40.083
Hey, that's An-Jin, the Swift Wind!

24:40.166 --> 24:42.583
[man 13] He's right.
It's An-Jin, the Swift Wind!

24:43.291 --> 24:44.125
[Enju] Wow.

24:44.208 --> 24:46.000
Kyoto PD, huh?

24:46.500 --> 24:48.458
Anyway, as long as you're here,

24:48.541 --> 24:50.875
you're considered a participant as well.

24:50.958 --> 24:53.000
You don't know who you're dealing with.

24:53.083 --> 24:55.458
Of course I do. An-Jin, the Swift Wind.

24:55.541 --> 24:56.541
So good with a sword

24:56.625 --> 24:59.208
that even the Shinsengumi
wouldn't have stood a chance.

24:59.291 --> 25:00.541
Or at least that's what

25:00.625 --> 25:03.333
you like to tell everyone, right?

25:03.416 --> 25:05.083
Because that's the truth.

25:05.666 --> 25:07.833
You're all under arrest
for breaking the sword ban.

25:07.916 --> 25:09.166
[clamoring]

25:09.250 --> 25:12.166
There's no need to be a spoilsport.
We're just having some fun.

25:12.250 --> 25:14.166
Who's the mastermind? Where is he?

25:15.250 --> 25:16.208
No idea.

25:17.125 --> 25:20.333
Show me your hands, or I'll cut them off.

25:22.041 --> 25:23.166
Is that right?

25:23.708 --> 25:26.208
I guess that means
that you won't participate?

25:26.708 --> 25:27.791
Oh…

25:29.083 --> 25:30.208
Pity, isn't it?

25:30.291 --> 25:32.791
Hm. You're crazy.

25:32.875 --> 25:35.458
-[dramatic music playing]
-[gasping]

25:41.291 --> 25:42.291
[gasping]

25:55.583 --> 25:58.750
Pardon me
for the brief interruption, folks.

25:59.541 --> 26:01.291
[crowd murmuring faintly]

26:01.375 --> 26:05.166
Anyway… Let the countdown recommence.

26:10.458 --> 26:11.416
Twenty-four.

26:12.125 --> 26:14.208
-[man 14] Wait. What the hell? Wait.
-Twenty-three.

26:14.708 --> 26:15.750
Twenty-two.

26:15.833 --> 26:19.291
-[man 14] What do I do?
-Twenty-one. Twenty.

26:19.375 --> 26:21.583
-[man 15] He killed that guy.
-[Enju] Nineteen.

26:21.666 --> 26:23.500
-Are you leaving?
-[Enju] Eighteen…

26:23.583 --> 26:26.125
-[man 16] I'm out of here!
-[man 17] Hey, wait, don't give up!

26:26.208 --> 26:27.125
[Enju] Sixteen.

26:27.208 --> 26:29.000
-[man 18] I'm not backing out!
-[Enju] Fifteen…

26:29.083 --> 26:30.041
[man 18] I'm doing this!

26:30.125 --> 26:33.166
Even if I quit now,
I don't think I'd be any better off.

26:34.208 --> 26:35.125
[Enju] Twelve.

26:36.291 --> 26:37.208
Eleven.

26:38.083 --> 26:38.958
Ten.

26:39.750 --> 26:42.291
-[man 19] Not gonna end up like that guy!
-[Enju] Nine. Eight.

26:43.291 --> 26:44.291
Seven.

26:45.250 --> 26:48.500
-Six. Five.
-[man 19 yells]

26:48.583 --> 26:49.416
Four.

26:51.625 --> 26:53.000
Three, two, one.

26:53.625 --> 26:54.791
[dramatic sting]

26:55.375 --> 26:56.625
That's amazing.

26:57.958 --> 27:01.625
The bravery you're showing
impresses me deeply.

27:01.708 --> 27:03.416
[breathing shakily]

27:08.875 --> 27:10.666
[indistinct murmuring]

27:26.875 --> 27:30.250
MAP OF TOKAIDO ROAD
TENRYUJI TEMPLE

27:30.833 --> 27:34.583
All right. This game you are agreeing
to take part in is called…

27:35.291 --> 27:36.791
"Kodoku."

27:36.875 --> 27:40.000
Naturally,
every game comes with its rules.

27:41.375 --> 27:42.750
Take one of these.

27:42.833 --> 27:44.291
[guard 1] Write down your name.

27:44.375 --> 27:47.083
[Enju] I will now explain them in detail.

27:47.666 --> 27:50.583
-[guard 2] Wear this around your neck.
-Are we not supposed to take it off?

27:51.750 --> 27:52.666
Rule one.

27:52.750 --> 27:56.333
From this moment on,
Tokyo will be your final stop.

27:57.291 --> 27:58.208
Rule two.

27:59.041 --> 28:01.583
The main gates of Tenryuji Temple,

28:01.666 --> 28:03.416
Ise Province's Seki,

28:03.500 --> 28:05.750
Mikawa Province's Chiryu,

28:05.833 --> 28:07.583
Totoumi Province's Hamamatsu,

28:08.083 --> 28:10.166
Suruga Province's Shimada,

28:10.250 --> 28:12.166
Sagami Province's Hakone,

28:12.250 --> 28:14.125
Musashi Province's Shinagawa.

28:14.750 --> 28:17.791
You have to go through
all seven of these locations.

28:17.875 --> 28:19.958
107 KOUEMON TACHIKAWA - 108 SHUJIRO SAGA

28:20.041 --> 28:21.416
[guard 2] Put this on.

28:23.083 --> 28:24.291
Rule three.

28:24.791 --> 28:27.458
You are going to need
a certain amount of points

28:27.541 --> 28:29.666
in order to pass through each province.

28:30.166 --> 28:32.958
-[guard 2] Wear this around your neck.
-[Enju] Rule four.

28:34.000 --> 28:37.083
Under no circumstances
are you to tell anyone else about this.

28:37.666 --> 28:38.666
[guard 2] Sign here.

28:38.750 --> 28:39.750
[Enju] Rule five.

28:40.250 --> 28:43.083
You are required to be in Tokyo no later

28:43.166 --> 28:45.458
than June 5th, one month from today.

28:46.250 --> 28:47.333
Rule six.

28:47.833 --> 28:50.291
You cannot abandon the game at any point.

28:50.375 --> 28:53.333
That said, should your wooden tag

28:53.416 --> 28:56.166
be removed from your body,
and ten counts pass,

28:56.875 --> 28:59.250
it will count as a withdrawal.

28:59.833 --> 29:01.333
[guard 2] Wear this at all times.

29:01.416 --> 29:02.666
[breathing shakily]

29:02.750 --> 29:03.833
Rule seven.

29:04.541 --> 29:07.625
-Anyone who dares break the rules…
-[man 20 screaming]

29:09.833 --> 29:10.916
[crowd clamoring]

29:13.541 --> 29:15.708
Ten. Nine.

29:15.791 --> 29:17.541
-[man 20] No! I don't wanna do it!
-Eight.

29:18.375 --> 29:19.666
-Seven.
-[man 20] Let me out!

29:19.750 --> 29:21.000
[Enju] Six.

29:21.083 --> 29:21.958
Five.

29:22.833 --> 29:23.708
Four.

29:24.375 --> 29:26.208
-Open the gate!
-[Enju] Three.Two.

29:27.625 --> 29:28.541
One.

29:30.208 --> 29:31.333
[screaming]

29:32.541 --> 29:33.791
[gasping]

29:34.750 --> 29:35.708
[groaning]

29:38.916 --> 29:40.500
[breathing shakily]

29:45.666 --> 29:47.666
[dramatic music playing]

29:48.541 --> 29:49.625
Rule seven.

29:51.625 --> 29:53.708
Anyone who dares break the rules

29:54.916 --> 29:56.666
is going to earn their punishment.

30:02.541 --> 30:03.791
This is insane.

30:08.166 --> 30:10.375
You didn't say anything
about getting killed!

30:10.458 --> 30:11.916
-[clamoring]
-You liar!

30:12.500 --> 30:14.125
No! You little liar!

30:14.208 --> 30:16.708
[man 21] That's not
what we signed up for! Hey!

30:16.791 --> 30:19.833
-[man 22] I want out of here!
-[man 23] We're gonna die here!

30:19.916 --> 30:21.750
[indistinct shouting]

30:24.250 --> 30:25.583
Now be quiet!

30:25.666 --> 30:26.875
[crowd falls silent]

30:29.708 --> 30:31.416
I gave you a choice, didn't I?

30:31.500 --> 30:33.250
And you've made your decision.

30:34.250 --> 30:35.750
No turning back.

30:36.708 --> 30:40.250
When you heard about the 100,000 yen,
your mind was already set.

30:42.083 --> 30:43.750
You are part of this game now.

30:43.833 --> 30:44.875
[breathing heavily]

30:52.833 --> 30:53.833
Let's get back to it.

30:53.916 --> 30:57.416
A total of 292 participants
are gathered here tonight.

30:57.500 --> 31:00.500
Each of you has a wooden tag
which counts as one point.

31:01.000 --> 31:03.083
Which means you already hold one point.

31:05.125 --> 31:07.916
In order to get through Tenryuji
and head to the next post,

31:08.000 --> 31:09.708
you'll need at least two points.

31:10.583 --> 31:15.083
And you'll need 30 points
to enter Tokyo, the final destination.

31:15.166 --> 31:17.791
SHINAGAWA, MUSASHI PROVINCE - 30 POINTS
NIHONBASHI

31:18.875 --> 31:21.250
Figured out how to earn points yet?

31:24.291 --> 31:25.291
[gasps]

31:28.208 --> 31:30.375
Looks like some of you already have.

31:31.875 --> 31:34.166
No way. He… can't be serious.

31:34.250 --> 31:36.250
[foreboding music playing]

31:39.875 --> 31:41.750
Nothing is off limits.

31:42.375 --> 31:44.416
Tear the tags from each other's necks!

31:44.500 --> 31:46.375
[dramatic music playing]

31:59.041 --> 32:02.250
[Enju] I see many here
who endured the chaos of a bygone age.

32:02.333 --> 32:04.333
True survivors among the samurai.

32:05.000 --> 32:09.541
And they are the ones most worthy
of receiving such a generous prize.

32:10.958 --> 32:17.166
Now, show us the courage
that defines the samurai legacy.

32:21.958 --> 32:23.958
Excuse me. Should we team up?

32:24.958 --> 32:27.375
Some people came
all the way here with their friends.

32:27.458 --> 32:29.333
It's better than going solo, right?

32:29.416 --> 32:32.458
If you want, I could help you
with my sword fighting skills.

32:33.333 --> 32:35.875
All right. I'm going to start a ten-count,

32:36.833 --> 32:38.250
and the game will begin.

32:38.333 --> 32:40.000
[breathing shakily]

32:47.166 --> 32:48.916
Why is there a child here?

32:49.458 --> 32:50.375
Ten.

32:52.416 --> 32:53.291
Nine.

32:55.416 --> 32:56.458
Eight.

32:58.125 --> 32:59.875
-Seven.
-[swords swishing]

33:00.458 --> 33:01.833
Six.

33:01.916 --> 33:03.208
Five.

33:04.208 --> 33:05.416
Four.

33:06.000 --> 33:07.250
Three.

33:08.041 --> 33:09.000
Two.

33:10.250 --> 33:11.166
One.

33:17.333 --> 33:21.375
Then I will be waiting, in Tokyo.
Or rather…

33:27.125 --> 33:29.916
in Edo, the city lost since that day.

33:30.000 --> 33:32.291
Hopefully, our paths cross once more.

33:32.375 --> 33:34.291
[dramatic music intensifies]

33:43.166 --> 33:44.791
And begin!

33:48.458 --> 33:49.916
[crowd breathing heavily]

33:52.416 --> 33:53.750
[indistinct muttering]

33:54.833 --> 33:55.750
[grunts]

33:55.833 --> 33:58.833
-[groans, gurgles]
-[crowd gasping]

33:58.916 --> 34:00.041
[tense music playing]

34:00.708 --> 34:02.208
That's one point.

34:04.458 --> 34:05.875
-[groans]
-[crowd clamoring]

34:10.291 --> 34:12.208
[riveting drums playing]

34:14.375 --> 34:16.750
[grunting, screaming]

34:32.541 --> 34:34.000
[gun firing]

34:38.666 --> 34:40.333
[breathing shakily]

34:48.375 --> 34:49.875
[groans]

34:55.125 --> 34:56.666
[music distorting]

35:02.041 --> 35:03.416
[man 24 grunts]

35:06.166 --> 35:08.166
[suspenseful music playing]

35:18.250 --> 35:20.208
[breathing heavily]

35:30.458 --> 35:31.583
[laughs]

35:32.250 --> 35:33.250
[grunting]

35:40.291 --> 35:41.125
[grunts]

35:50.666 --> 35:52.000
[grunting]

35:56.625 --> 35:57.541
[screams]

35:58.458 --> 36:00.166
She's mine! [cackles]

36:04.333 --> 36:05.500
[straining]

36:09.958 --> 36:11.125
[grunts, laughs]

36:11.208 --> 36:12.541
[breathing shakily]

36:14.458 --> 36:16.208
[suspenseful music intensifies]

36:20.500 --> 36:22.750
Let's do this! [grunts]

36:25.458 --> 36:26.375
[yells]

36:29.750 --> 36:30.875
[woman grunts]

36:30.958 --> 36:32.125
[groans]

36:37.916 --> 36:38.916
[grunting]

36:40.458 --> 36:42.125
[distant clamoring]

36:43.458 --> 36:44.458
[gun firing]

36:44.541 --> 36:47.125
[footsteps approaching]

36:49.041 --> 36:49.916
[Enju] Sakura.

36:52.083 --> 36:55.458
Does this bring back any… memories?

36:57.541 --> 36:58.541
No.

37:00.750 --> 37:01.750
[chuckles softly]

37:10.333 --> 37:12.208
[guard] Congratulations
on making it through.

37:12.875 --> 37:14.291
Your wooden tags, please.

37:17.083 --> 37:18.416
[gunshots]

37:19.000 --> 37:20.541
Kikuomi Ukyo.

37:21.250 --> 37:22.833
First one to make it through.

37:23.541 --> 37:25.750
You're truly a Guardian of the Nobility.

37:26.583 --> 37:31.000
-What foul plan are you weaving right now?
-I'm planning to be in Tokyo, waiting.

37:36.750 --> 37:38.125
Confirmation complete.

37:38.708 --> 37:39.541
Well…

37:40.583 --> 37:42.041
Safe travels.

37:47.250 --> 37:49.083
[eerie music playing]

37:54.666 --> 37:56.833
-[dramatic music playing]
-[panting]

37:58.208 --> 37:59.333
[man 1] Father!

38:06.916 --> 38:08.083
[gunshots]

38:09.333 --> 38:12.541
Oh. Uh, thank you so much.

38:12.625 --> 38:14.083
Do you want to survive?

38:16.583 --> 38:17.875
I do, yes.

38:18.583 --> 38:20.625
I wanna live to save my mother, sir.

38:22.500 --> 38:24.208
Don't leave my side
until we get out of here.

38:24.291 --> 38:25.958
I'll keep you safe.

38:26.708 --> 38:27.541
All right.

38:27.625 --> 38:29.333
[man 2] I found him,
the one with the girl!

38:29.416 --> 38:31.291
-They're under the building!
-Let's go.

38:40.000 --> 38:41.333
[breathing heavily]

38:47.416 --> 38:48.541
I got one!

38:48.625 --> 38:49.583
[grunting]

38:53.500 --> 38:54.666
[screaming]

39:00.041 --> 39:01.208
[yells]

39:03.625 --> 39:04.625
Go!

39:05.125 --> 39:07.083
[man 3 grunts, yelps]

39:07.166 --> 39:09.250
-[crowd gasping, clamoring]
-[screams]

39:25.750 --> 39:28.875
-[man 4] Got it! [grunts] Oh yeah!
-[girl shrieks] Give it back!

39:28.958 --> 39:31.541
-[straining] Give it back!
-[shooter] Ten.

39:32.166 --> 39:33.666
-[grunts]
-[shooter] Nine.

39:35.000 --> 39:35.833
Eight.

39:37.333 --> 39:38.166
Seven.

39:38.958 --> 39:40.208
Six.

39:40.291 --> 39:41.583
Give it back!

39:41.666 --> 39:42.708
[shooter] Five.

39:43.791 --> 39:45.083
Four.

39:46.041 --> 39:47.208
Three.

39:47.291 --> 39:48.625
-[man 4 screams]
-Two.

39:50.458 --> 39:51.500
-One.
-[grunting]

39:52.333 --> 39:53.750
120

39:57.041 --> 39:58.416
[panting]

40:09.250 --> 40:11.333
[grunts] Hang on!

40:11.416 --> 40:14.000
[man 5] Who took my tag? Hand it over!

40:14.083 --> 40:15.083
[clamoring]

40:18.083 --> 40:19.208
-Hang on!
-[girl screams]

40:19.291 --> 40:20.916
[man 5] Come on, give it to me!

40:21.541 --> 40:22.500
I'll kill you, samurai!

40:24.083 --> 40:26.833
-[breathing heavily]
-[screaming]

40:29.250 --> 40:31.125
[tense music playing]

40:40.208 --> 40:41.958
[gasping, panting]

40:58.083 --> 40:59.750
[man 6 yelps]

41:07.166 --> 41:08.083
Let's go.

41:10.500 --> 41:11.333
[groans]

41:23.041 --> 41:26.291
So you're not
who I'm after either, are you?

41:33.541 --> 41:36.125
-[grunting]
-[screaming]

41:38.000 --> 41:38.875
[laughs]

41:41.833 --> 41:42.791
[girl groans]

41:47.833 --> 41:48.916
[exhales]

41:50.916 --> 41:52.333
[yelps, groans]

41:53.791 --> 41:54.833
[laughing]

41:59.500 --> 42:01.375
[man 7 screams]

42:04.750 --> 42:06.500
[men laughing]

42:07.541 --> 42:08.833
-Hmm.
-Oh.

42:10.000 --> 42:11.750
-Ah.
-[chuckling]

42:11.833 --> 42:13.208
[sinister music playing]

42:13.291 --> 42:14.750
[man 1] Oh! [chuckles]

42:14.833 --> 42:16.083
[man 2] If I may…

42:18.875 --> 42:20.958
Our first participant has made it through.

42:23.708 --> 42:27.166
Number 19, Kikuomi Ukyo.

42:27.250 --> 42:28.625
Ah.

42:29.291 --> 42:33.083
He's truly living up to the name,
"Guardian of the Nobility."

42:33.166 --> 42:36.416
Former Guardian, right?
A lot has happened since.

42:36.500 --> 42:39.708
Well, in any case,
he's clearly still skillful with a sword.

42:39.791 --> 42:42.750
-Hm.
-He's putting on quite the show for us.

42:42.833 --> 42:45.583
-[laughs]
-Well, this is only the beginning.

42:46.333 --> 42:48.083
The real fun is yet to come.

42:48.166 --> 42:49.916
[laughing]

42:53.291 --> 42:54.875
-[panting]
-[woman screaming]

42:55.958 --> 42:58.458
-[grunting]
-[shrieking]

42:58.541 --> 42:59.583
This way!

43:06.583 --> 43:08.125
[distant clamoring]

43:11.291 --> 43:12.458
What's your name?

43:14.333 --> 43:15.708
Katsuki Futaba.

43:15.791 --> 43:17.041
And you, sir?

43:17.125 --> 43:18.541
Saga Shujiro.

43:21.708 --> 43:22.541
Huh?

43:23.375 --> 43:25.375
We just need to make it to the gate now.

43:25.458 --> 43:27.791
-Wait, but your tag--
-[footsteps approaching]

43:42.333 --> 43:44.333
[ominous music playing]

43:47.958 --> 43:49.250
[breath trembling]

44:00.875 --> 44:02.583
[ominous music intensifies]

44:06.666 --> 44:07.541
[man gurgles]

44:19.666 --> 44:20.708
[chuckles softly]

44:21.291 --> 44:23.750
Hey, calm down. You can relax, okay?

44:23.833 --> 44:25.833
I've got no intention of fighting you.

44:26.416 --> 44:28.041
I'll get his tag.

44:28.125 --> 44:30.666
Just don't go slashing
at me all of a sudden.

44:41.916 --> 44:44.208
Here you go. You take it.

44:47.541 --> 44:49.208
What're you trying to pull here?

44:50.333 --> 44:53.083
Listen, why aren't you going all out,

44:53.166 --> 44:55.250
"Kokushu the Manslayer?"

44:56.833 --> 44:58.333
[unsettling music playing]

45:02.083 --> 45:04.208
Losing grip on your mind, are ya?

45:06.208 --> 45:08.916
Insomnia. Hands shake, heart races…

45:09.000 --> 45:13.416
The Boshin War sure got a lot
of people outright losing their minds.

45:15.416 --> 45:16.291
But

45:16.375 --> 45:18.916
if you
and that little miss intend to survive,

45:19.000 --> 45:20.583
then you gotta start killing.

45:24.166 --> 45:26.833
Well, it's your call, though.

45:28.083 --> 45:28.916
Hold on!

45:32.583 --> 45:34.166
Thank you so much.

45:35.166 --> 45:36.041
[exhales]

45:36.750 --> 45:39.250
I'm rooting for ya.
So hang in there, all right?

45:43.166 --> 45:44.583
[footsteps receding]

45:47.125 --> 45:47.958
254

45:52.500 --> 45:54.208
We better get out of here now.

45:55.458 --> 45:56.375
All right.

45:58.166 --> 46:00.166
-[panting]
-[men groaning]

46:13.333 --> 46:15.333
[dramatic music playing]

46:22.791 --> 46:25.625
-[man 1 shrieks]
-[grunting]

46:32.666 --> 46:33.958
Here we go!

46:37.166 --> 46:38.916
You go ahead. Hurry!

46:40.541 --> 46:41.666
Go!

46:41.750 --> 46:43.375
-[breathing heavily]
-[roars]

46:44.125 --> 46:45.583
[both grunting]

46:56.791 --> 46:57.916
[laughing]

47:12.791 --> 47:14.416
[both grunting]

47:31.125 --> 47:32.333
[screams]

47:37.250 --> 47:38.833
[panting]

47:38.916 --> 47:40.083
[groans]

47:42.958 --> 47:44.666
-[shrieks]
-[yelps]

47:45.875 --> 47:47.125
[clamoring]

47:52.625 --> 47:55.083
[dramatic music intensifies]

48:07.333 --> 48:08.583
[groaning]

48:10.625 --> 48:11.625
[panting]

48:27.125 --> 48:30.833
Congratulations on making it through.
Your wooden tags, please.

48:31.500 --> 48:33.541
[Saga breathing heavily]

48:43.166 --> 48:46.458
Uh, thank you so much, sir.

48:46.958 --> 48:48.666
We're going to a friend's inn.

48:48.750 --> 48:50.166
Stay alert.

48:51.208 --> 48:52.750
Confirmation complete.

48:56.833 --> 48:58.291
Safe travels.

49:06.666 --> 49:07.541
[doors opening]

49:17.916 --> 49:20.208
[ominous music playing]

49:28.583 --> 49:30.083
[thunder rumbling]

49:30.166 --> 49:31.291
[rain falling]

49:37.583 --> 49:41.541
-[man 1] Ah, it's started to rain.
-[man 2] Oh! [chuckles]

49:42.125 --> 49:44.041
[man 1] Quite the downfall we're getting.

49:45.833 --> 49:47.833
Number 108, Saga Shujiro,

49:47.916 --> 49:51.083
and number 120,
Katsuki Futaba, just made it through.

49:51.166 --> 49:54.041
-Oh.
-Saga Shujiro.

49:54.125 --> 49:56.666
Kokushu the Manslayer, right?

49:56.750 --> 49:59.375
With a child in tow, huh? [chuckles]

49:59.458 --> 50:02.708
-Wow. It's getting interesting!
-[men laugh]

50:04.000 --> 50:06.166
Gentlemen. One more moment of your time.

50:06.250 --> 50:09.041
-What is it? It was just getting good.
-[man 2] Mm.

50:09.541 --> 50:12.291
I have just received a letter
from the mastermind.

50:17.458 --> 50:19.291
Allow me to read it for you.

50:21.875 --> 50:23.000
[dramatic music playing]

50:23.083 --> 50:25.666
"To all who have agreed to this game,
this Kodoku,

50:25.750 --> 50:28.541
I extend my deepest gratitude."

50:31.083 --> 50:32.250
"The samurai,

50:33.666 --> 50:36.750
they are capable
of nothing more than swinging swords."

50:38.416 --> 50:40.208
"They boast their authority,

50:41.416 --> 50:43.666
and they mistake it for true power."

50:44.791 --> 50:48.416
"They haven't even noticed
how the world has left them behind."

50:49.375 --> 50:53.166
"They drag out their days,
blind to their own pointlessness."

50:54.958 --> 50:56.750
"So take pleasure."

50:56.833 --> 51:00.416
"Indulge in this cruel dance
that will finally lay them to rest,

51:01.791 --> 51:04.916
these ghosts who call themselves samurai."

51:11.333 --> 51:12.375
[man 1 laughs]

51:18.416 --> 51:19.750
[yelling, grunting]

51:19.833 --> 51:22.208
-[riveting drums playing]
-[panting]

51:29.791 --> 51:31.791
[dramatic music playing]

51:33.666 --> 51:35.166
[man] It's been a while, hasn't it?

51:36.083 --> 51:37.250
Kokushu.

51:38.708 --> 51:40.125
Kanjiya Bukotsu…

51:40.916 --> 51:43.291
What's it been, ten years?

51:44.041 --> 51:46.291
I've been waiting for this moment.

51:47.000 --> 51:49.166
I figured I'd find you here.

51:53.583 --> 51:54.750
Let's do this…

51:59.500 --> 52:01.875
Kokushu the Manslayer!

52:04.791 --> 52:06.041
[grunting]

52:07.833 --> 52:09.208
[laughs]

52:12.125 --> 52:13.750
[breathing shakily]

52:16.916 --> 52:18.250
-[laughs]
-[groans]

52:19.208 --> 52:22.916
128 REMAINING

52:23.000 --> 52:25.291
[dramatic music fades]

52:25.375 --> 52:27.458
[ambient music playing]

56:37.083 --> 56:38.250
[music fades]
